{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/tbl-q-beta-cos-resummation-table-data","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Table","doco:Table"],"label":"tbl:q-beta-cos-resummation-table-data","kind":"table","title":"Data table from prop:q-beta-cos-resummation","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-q-beta-cos-resummation"],"tags":["extracted-table"],"text":"q-beta-cos-resummation-table-data.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"tbl:q-beta-cos-resummation-table-data\"></a><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>quantity</th>\n<th align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q_0</code> value</th>\n<th>role</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z_D = q^3/(q^2+1)</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.6126880371</code></td>\n<td>Markov parameter (convention D)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h = q - q^{-1}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.2090602988</code></td>\n<td>quantum-integer differential</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha = (z_D-1)h/2</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-0.0404857773</code></td>\n<td>single-wrap eigenphase</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\cos\\alpha</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.9991805629</code></td>\n<td>resummation factor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{Q}_\\beta^{z_D}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.4447004085</code> MeV</td>\n<td>ruled base</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{Q}_\\beta^{z_D,\\cos}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.4443360045</code> MeV</td>\n<td>ruled base, cos-dressed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{Q}_\\beta^A</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.7836458274</code> MeV</td>\n<td>Form A (retired, historical)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{Q}_\\beta^{A,\\cos}</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.7830036789</code> MeV</td>\n<td>Form A, cos-dressed under D</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CODATA <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{Q}_\\beta</code></td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0.78233341</code> MeV</td>\n<td>comparison value</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>residual (ruled base)</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-431571.8</code> ppm</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>residual (ruled base, cos)</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">-432037.5</code> ppm</td>\n<td>moves away from zero</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>residual (Form A)</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1677.6</code> ppm</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>residual (Form A, cos, D)</td>\n<td align=\"right\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+856.8</code> ppm</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1.96\\times</code> tighter</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><em>Until 2026-10-10 this table was convention C: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z \\approx 0.49932</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\alpha \\approx -0.05234</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\cos\\alpha \\approx 0.99863</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathfrak{Q}_\\beta^{A,\\cos} \\approx 0.78257</code> MeV, residual <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">+1677.5 \\to +305.7</code> ppm (<code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5.49\\times</code>).</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/q-beta-cos-resummation-table-data.md","heading":"Table"}
